            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.31+EXO.25.32+EXO.25.33+EXO.25.34+EXO.25.35+EXO.25.36+EXO.25.37+EXO.25.38+EXO.25.39+EXO.25.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 25.31-40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok otiyo okar-mac me jabu apar kit ma giciko-ni, oketogi i ot pa Lubaŋa; oketo abic yo tuŋ acuc ki abic yo tuŋ acam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.23+EXO.25.24+EXO.25.25+EXO.25.26+EXO.25.27+EXO.25.28+EXO.25.29+EXO.25.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 25.23-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En dok otiyo meja apar, oketogi i ot pa Lubaŋa, abic yo tuŋ acuc ki abic yo tuŋ acam. Dok otiyo becen me jabu miya acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok oyubo dyekal pa ajwagi, ki dyekal maditte, ki kika me dyekal, omwono kom ki ka ducu ki mola; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka oketo nam i twok ot i kin tuŋ acuc ki tuŋ wokceŋ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuram ocweyo agulu mapol bene, ki akwaya, ki becen-gu, Kit meno Kuram otyeko tic i kom ot pa Lubaŋa pi kabaka Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otiyo wir aryo, ki lalukana aryo ma oluŋŋe macalo agulu ma giketo i wi wir, ki obwo aryo me umo kom lalukana aryo ma oluŋŋe ma obedo i wi wir-ri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok otiyo cal okwer pomegranat miya aŋwen pi obwo aryo-nu, kun cal pomegranat giryeyo latyeŋ aryo i kom obwo acel acel me umo kom lalukana aryo ma oluŋŋe ma obedo i wi wir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otiyo bene litino gadigadi apar, ki otakomola apar ma giluto i litino gadigadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki nam acel, ki cal twoni dyaŋi apar wiye aryo ma i te namo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak agulu ki akwaya latokke-gu, ki gin lacob riŋo, ki jami ducu ma mitte pi tic ki jami magi ma Kuram-abi otiyogi pi ot pa Rwot ki pi kabaka Solomon obedo me mola ma gijwane maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka omiyo giliyo mola meno i pwor kulu Jordan, ka ma lobo agulu tye iye, i kin Cukot ki Jereda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon otimo gin lwak jami-nu madwoŋ twatwal, ma pek pa molane pe gikwano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon otiyo jami ducu ma tye i ot pa Lubaŋa kit man: keno tyer me jabu, ki lwak meja me caŋo mugati ma giketo i nyim Rwot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okar-mac ki lwak laputgi me jabu ma giliyo maber, ma myero gubed ka lyel i kabedo maleŋ ma i tyelo, kit ma giciko-ni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki lwak cal ature, ki laput-gu, ki boyi lakar mac, ducu me jabu ma giliyo maber makato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magac-gu, becen-gu, atabo me odok eceta, ki weer me waŋo mac otiyogi ki jabu ma giliyo maber; ki pata me ot pa Lubaŋa ma giketo i kom kika me kabedo maleŋ ma i tyelo, ki i kika me kicika maditte bene, gubedo me jabu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
